{
  "name": "Magma Vein",
  "notes": "A crack with fire behind it. This is `showcase/18-lava-lamp`'s thresholded noise turned inside out and done in colour rather than in black: instead of dark entries switching the field off, a `paletteSpan` of 3.2 with `wrap` off runs the index far past both ends, so most of the field CLAMPS to the first entry -- deep cobalt -- and only the crests climb through the ember run to gold. The threshold is `indexBias`, and moving it is the difference between a hairline crack and a strip that is mostly molten.\n\nThat matters because it keeps the dark part of the image a saturated colour rather than an absence. A blue-black crust reads as cold rock; actual black reads as a broken LED.\n\nThe chain is the crust moving independently of what is behind it. `M2` drives `M0.rate` -- the vein's opening and closing accelerates on a noise clock -- while the crust layer above scrolls on its own and is blended `multiply`, so it removes red where it is dense and the fire only shows through where the rock is thin. Premultiplied multiply is `(1 - alpha) + src`, so a cobalt crust at 0.6 opacity leaves the green and blue and eats the red, which is exactly what a shadow over a fire should do. Ember run 350 to 42 degrees, crust at 220.",
  "layers": {
    "0": {
      "emitter": {
        "type": "perlin",
        "params": {
          "scale": 0.8,
          "evolve": 0
        }
      },
      "colour": {
        "index": "u",
        "params": {
          "paletteSpan": 3.2,
          "indexBias": -0.55
        },
        "palette": {
          "params": {
            "saturation": 2,
            "value": 2
          },
          "entries": [
            "0028ff",
            "ff0028",
            "ff5000",
            "ffaa00",
            "ffe600"
          ]
        }
      },
      "warps": [
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "wrap": true,
          "params": {
            "offset": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "blend": "add",
      "opacity": 1,
      "order": 0
    },
    "1": {
      "emitter": {
        "type": "perlin",
        "params": {
          "scale": 2,
          "evolve": 0
        }
      },
      "colour": {
        "index": "u",
        "palette": {
          "params": {
            "saturation": 2,
            "value": 2
          },
          "entries": [
            "0028ff",
            "0064ff"
          ]
        }
      },
      "warps": [
        {
          "type": "translate",
          "wrap": true,
          "params": {
            "offset": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "scale",
          "params": {
            "zoom": 1,
            "centre": 0.5
          }
        }
      ],
      "blend": "multiply",
      "opacity": 0.6,
      "order": 1
    }
  },
  "modulators": {
    "0": {
      "type": "lfo",
      "wave": "sine",
      "params": {
        "rate": 0.024
      }
    },
    "1": {
      "type": "lfo",
      "wave": "sine",
      "params": {
        "rate": 0.009
      }
    },
    "2": {
